      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.69 (up from ₹0.60 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.53b (up 71% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹256.8m (up 41% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 10% (down from 12% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue is forecast to grow 42% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 18% growth forecast for the Aerospace & Defense industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 39% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 94% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
